{"3715730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Femboy Love story", "steam_appid": 3715730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>How to fix crashes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game crashes for you, please do the following.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In Steam Library, find &quot;Femboy Love Story&quot; or &quot;男娘恋爱物语&quot;, right click and select &quot;properties&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Select &quot;betas&quot; on the left, enter the code【pleasedontcrashme】, (without【】), click &quot;check code&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Select 【electron】in top right corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Start the game after download is finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please post in community if you still encounter problems.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715730/extras/fcfc3dd5e6acf2a47821dd41011d5d21.avif?t=1773909645\" width=600 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, did you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy’s lips feel just the same as a girl’s…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever held a girl’s hand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever kissed a girl on her sweet little lips?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy little femboy — wouldn’t you like a taste?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun Visual Novel about conquering your femboy flatmate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Li Fei, a fresher just starting university. On your very first day, you bump into a peerless beauty at the stadium. Later, back in your dorm, you find out that this peerless beauty is actually your roommate…and he is a boy. A sweet, soft little femboy with a lovely scent!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Profiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Li Fei</strong>: The protagonist in this visual novel, a first year undergraduate student, straight guy, interested in fitness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xiao Mei</strong> (CV: Zhang YuQi): Li Fei’s flatmate, Loves wearing cute dresses and suspenders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other information</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Around 20 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Word Count: About 12,000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CGs: 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Acting: Fully voiced, except for the protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weibo: @磷光工作室的沙哥</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @磷光工作室的沙哥</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 167222263</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715730/extras/fcfc3dd5e6acf2a47821dd41011d5d21.avif?t=1773909645\" width=600 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, did you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy’s lips feel just the same as a girl’s…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever held a girl’s hand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever kissed a girl on her sweet little lips?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy little femboy — wouldn’t you like a taste?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun Visual Novel about conquering your femboy flatmate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Li Fei, a fresher just starting university. On your very first day, you bump into a peerless beauty at the stadium. Later, back in your dorm, you find out that this peerless beauty is actually your roommate…and he is a boy. A sweet, soft little